 141: # If an interrupted turn never settles (agent thread hung in a syscall, supervisor lost), each 1s poll would
 142: # otherwise reschedule forever — trading the old leak-one-worker bug for leak-one-session-plus-timer-chain
 143: # (review finding, PR #90373). After this many polls we log loudly and force-reap, mirroring the
